23599,"Verification - Important Account Information
We were unable to verify your account information during our regular database verification process. This might be due to one or more of the following reasons: 1. A recent change in your personal information (i.e. change of phone number). 2. Submitting invalid information during initial enrollment process. 3. Inability to accurately verify your account information due to an internal error within our database management system. We would require the renewal of your records to forestall a reoccurrence of any future problems with your online service. However, failure to update your records might result in your account being suspended. Please note that you're updating of information, will not interrupt your services. Begin verification",i09,Software and Device Operations,"GENERAL SETTINGS
